<view class="page">
  <view class="scan-card">
    <view class="scan-title">扫码签到</view>
    <view class="scan-tip">扫描场地二维码，或输入管理员提供的签到码</view>
    <button class="btn-primary scan-btn" bindtap="scan">打开相机扫码</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">手动输入签到码</view>
    <input
      class="input"
      value="{{token}}"
      placeholder="例如 demo-qr-token-0001"
      bindinput="onTokenInput"
    />
    <button
      class="btn-ghost"
      style="margin-top: 20rpx;"
      bindtap="manualSubmit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
    >提交签到码</button>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 14rpx;">
      演示环境可以直接使用种子数据里的签到码。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-title">我的待签到预约</view>
    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中...</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{pending.length === 0}}" class="empty">暂无待签到预约</view>
    <view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="id" class="pending-row">
      <view>
        <view class="pending-name">{{item.resourceName}}</view>
        <view class="muted">{{item.timeText}} · {{item.building}} {{item.room}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pending-actions">
        <button
          class="btn-ghost btn-small"
          bindtap="photoCheckin"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          loading="{{submitting}}"
        >拍照签到</button>
        <button
          class="btn-primary btn-small"
          bindtap="selfCheckin"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          loading="{{submitting}}"
        >签到</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="rule-tip">
    签到窗口为预约开始后 15 分钟内。开始前或超时后无法签到，超时预约会被系统自动释放并记违约。
  </view>
</view>
